--TEST--
a payload value is an expression the checker records and the server walks the attribute lists to reach it, so an enum case inside `#[...]` answers the case it names exactly as one in a body does, `rule:attributes/payload-is-a-compile-time-constant`
--FILE--
<?nvs
enum Status: int {
    case Draft = 1;
    case Live = 2;
}

#[{state: Status::Li<|>ve}]
class Post
{
    public string $title = "";
}
--REQUEST--
definition
--EXPECT--
case.nvs:4:10
